# Live TUI on this machine: htop-style meters, answer-first headline, ranked groups, F-key bar.
Output docs/media/hero.gif
Set Width 1640
Set Height 960
Source docs/tapes/_setup.tape
Hide
# Public recording: only this user's processes (other accounts on the machine stay private).
Type "export OOMTOP_GENERAL__OTHER_USERS=false; clear"
Enter
Show
Type "oomtop"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 6s
Down
Sleep 700ms
Down
Sleep 700ms
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Type "i"
Sleep 3s
Escape
Sleep 800ms
Type "2"
Sleep 3s
Type "5"
Sleep 3s
Type "1"
Sleep 1s
Type "/"
Sleep 500ms
Type "claude"
Sleep 2.5s
Escape
Sleep 1.5s
Type "q"
Sleep 500ms
